                            <keyword start="1567089/25s" duration="4200/2500s" value="143 was that finn?"/>
                            <keyword start="1567132/25s" duration="7200/2500s" value="144 yeah..."/>
                            <keyword start="1567204/25s" duration="9000/2500s" value="145 so weird how he just drops by like he’s a friend of the fam."/>
                            <keyword start="1567274/25s" duration="16300/2500s" value="148 god mum, can you just chill?"/>
                            <keyword start="1567437/25s" duration="12100/2500s" value="150 you know, given he’s what made you run away."/>
                            <keyword start="1567558/25s" duration="11000/2500s" value="151 guess i’m a bit overwhelmed. (re: her phone) mum on the warpath and all."/>
                            <keyword start="1567668/25s" duration="3s" value="152 is there something else going on?"/>
                            <keyword start="1567743/25s" duration="7400/2500s" value="153 i might grab that shower..."/>
